## Integration acceptance

- Check mount and unmount, duplicate imports, native node replacement, safe and recovery mode and default-theme restoration for every supported adapter.
- Check the installed release and component versions before upgrading a claim from source-inspected to tested.
- Give every new family a versioned evidence row and a fallback. Keep unsupported families listed.

Record the environment, versions, state, method and result using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example does not show physical execution, screen-reader use or live compatibility.

Wording follows [Change only what Civica owns](../content/writing-guidelines/meet-household-needs.html#wg-002), [Refer to the actual interface](../content/writing-guidelines/clear-structure.html#wg-052), [Describe accessibility evidence accurately](../content/publish-update-retire/publish.html#wg-086) and [Report checks within their limits](../content/publish-update-retire/publish.html#wg-095).
